Cbc (Coin Branch-and-Cut) solves linear and mixed integer programming problems.
It is built together with the COIN-OR projects it uses: Cgl (Cut Generation
Library), Clp (Coin LP), Osi (Open Solver Interface) and CoinUtils.

Info [https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc].
From [https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc/releases] and the matching releases of
Cgl, Clp, Osi and CoinUtils.
